SUMMARY:Construction Simulator | Ep. 43 - Building the Nation's Next
 Emergency Toilet Stop
DESCRIPTION:Infrastructure matters, people! Back on the construction site,
 we're tackling possibly our most important project yet. Somewhere,
 someday, someone is going to be extremely grateful we built this.
 Construction Simulator is back - bigger and better than ever! Take charge
 of over 70 machines, dozens of them brand new to the franchise, and build
 to your heart's content on two huge maps - on your own or with your
 friends!
URL:https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0s0iDW16Xwk
CATEGORIES:Construction Simulator
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
