SUMMARY:Funnel Runners | Ep. 1 - It's Coming! It's Headed Right for Us!
DESCRIPTION:Our second new game of the week arrives, and apparently so
 does something enormous. Time to find out exactly what Funnel Runners has
 waiting for us - preferably without being launched into another postcode.
 Trapped in a doomed city, you and up to 7 friends must scavenge parts, fix
 your van, and escape the brutal tornado that approaches. A first-person
 co-op survival game with escalating disasters and total environmental
 destruction.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Funnel Runners
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
