SUMMARY:WET | Ep. 3 - The Walls Are Just Extra Footpaths
DESCRIPTION:Rubí returns for another evening of spectacularly unnecessary
 acrobatics, cinematic gunfights, slow-motion destruction, and further
 evidence that walking normally is for other people. A stylish action
 shooter that blends fast-paced gunplay, sword combat, and cinematic
 acrobatics. Players follow mercenary Rubi Malone as she takes on dangerous
 jobs, battling through waves of enemies using slow-motion stunts inspired
 by classic action films. Expect explosive set pieces, over-the-top action,
 and plenty of style.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:WET
