SUMMARY:Bayonetta Origins: Cereza and the Lost Demon | Ep. 2 - Cheshire,
 We Are NOT Keeping Whatever That Is
DESCRIPTION:We're heading back into the beautiful and mysterious Avalon
 Forest with Cereza and Cheshire. There are magical creatures everywhere,
 but no, Cheshire, that does not mean we're adopting all of them. A magical
 storybook adventure following a young Cereza, long before she became the
 legendary Bayonetta. Alongside her demon companion Cheshire, she explores
 an enchanted forest filled with puzzles, secrets, and dangerous creatures
 in a beautifully illustrated fantasy world.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Bayonetta Origins: Cereza and the Lost Demon
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
