SUMMARY:Red Dead Redemption II | Ep. 18 - Saint Denis Ain't No Place for
 Men Like Us
DESCRIPTION:Back to Saint Denis, where civilisation, crowded streets,
 money, politics, and the law make life increasingly complicated for people
 accustomed to solving problems from horseback. Arthur Morgan and the Van
 der Linde Gang are outlaws on the run. With federal agents and bounty
 hunters massing on their heels, the gang must rob, steal, and fight their
 way across the rugged heartland in order to survive.
URL:https://www.twitch.tv/dr_ravenholm
CATEGORIES:Red Dead Redemption II
STATUS:CONFIRMED
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
